{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 1074 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows fluconazole has been in shortage since 2022-01-13, and as of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on the list for 57 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for our product (NDC 51407042430) names Golden State Medical Supply, Inc. as the labeler and relabel/repack plant (FEI 3006458969) and Novitium Pharma LLC as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3012541241).",
      "cites": ["E10", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected Novitium Pharma LLC (FEI 3012541241) and classified the inspection VAI on 2019-02-04, with the classification letter dated 2019-04-03 — 1074 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2022-01-13.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected Golden State Medical Supply, Inc. (FEI 3006458969) multiple times, including an OAI classification on 2011-02-02 and a Warning Letter on 2011-04-26.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspections for both plants were classified NAI: Golden State Medical Supply, Inc. on 2025-06-11 and Novitium Pharma LLC on 2024-02-16.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 13 days on hand (164 units at 12.8/day) and Corvale General has 18 days on hand (289 units at 16.4/day).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
